    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a68ae931e73035027ef3bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身体的状况也十分良好，\n下次一定要追上“朋友”……\n于是便决定参加年底的“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4524b62befe57bb61fece40f6224cfc9ebfb5148e7103feb4445621d37d14064",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
