      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而在“有马纪念”这个大舞台上，\n还有古马级最为热门的两位赛马娘──\n好歌剧和名将怒涛正在等待着她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1759b6c38c0846ba3841e1d2ee0cdfe5cf8065cba9e89ea0db6bff614bacddc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
