    {
      "uid": "zhcn:485e93b24c0542852642e948",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在古马级赛马娘云集的“有马纪念”中，\n曼城茶座跑出了优秀的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7665a70851f6e6ec90aebdc39591ff153c988dc1930eab38602abcd2f4128fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025424.json",
