    {
      "uid": "zhcn:013e63cc5efca6c6fbdf945c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧追在后的曼城茶座眼中萌生阴郁的情感，\n趾甲的问题也更加严重。众人就这样怀着\n不好的预感，迎向“天皇赏（春）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4f881fd731f3059f009781a3b634247e7626ffd19611579be91117f65449379",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1025/storytimeline_501025424.json",
      "json_path": [
