    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7acfd321615a1cd820882e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而──尽情吃、尽情跑，\n曼城茶座从这样的特别周身上\n得到了某种启发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05512be58a36c8094107cd154858010ce468b39b156d8e3746c7068541ef43d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
