      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但曼城茶座却在“朋友”的指引下，\n表示要挑战国外的大型赛事。\n考量她趾甲的状况──风险实在太大了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3219b79ede572d1b5a93bc6a8e5894e6d5343dde2c280d2ecfea1bffd5c83dde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
