      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座成功窥探到超越极限后的风景。\n爱丽速子得知此事深感动摇，\n对自己不能亲眼看见十分不甘心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11adbecebd2bd3a1b9f7075e639caeada7c373aa5c759d48ed6ff4b15d2ad4ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
