    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecb36e89f38dc7ec0cbf9dfd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座则感到，\n自己会和无声铃鹿以及特别周的对决，\n都是由于“朋友”的引导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bf93870efcd00a8575b2fa650285479f93e676a36d9cea44de2aa23b60aaf1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
