      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使放弃了国外远征，\n“朋友”依旧引导着她……\n但她目前还不明白当中存在何种意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a148d4d01fdf68dd0d2e214fec3ba5e77fecb59941b47ad819a53dbc73bc123",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
