      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只能确定“朋友”仍待在曼城茶座身边。\n既然如此为了代替原先国外远征的计划，\n于是他们将下一个目标定为“日本杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d5a6b5f55aeb6ebde52b23d7cea31bea18fe85551135857dd7fa5f48a326de3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
