    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a12c6767a293ea2003abf1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座在“日本杯”跑出了好成绩。\n虽曾一度有过“朋友”或许是坏魔女的想法，\n但──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dfbf90ff9a83143341fe5296269dcb77e6c649305db4a232549f9858fea95e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
