      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄却告诉她，\n曼城茶座奔跑的模样不像是受了诅咒，\n反倒令人感觉十分耀眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15b14c9dc04a0b0e61bd3a9b07c91656f7b78e47fc72afc3d137b305b691ca61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
