      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而沉浸在赛后余韵的时间没有多久。\n在“朋友”强烈的引导下，\n他们又见到了昔日的耀眼光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c35a3df46da3ad972ae3260b400ebf8a10d76893ae72a590ec0f953d474fc9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
